WEBVTT

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:03.480
Can you hear me? Can you hear me?

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.890
Nee-san, it's Sapphire.

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:06.690
What's this?

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:09.020
Thank goodness. I got through.

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:12.240
This is your sister! You're safe, then?

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:15.080
I was captured with Miyu-sama,

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:17.620
but Miyu-sama waited for 
a chance to let me escape.

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:21.380
I've been hiding until now, unable to act.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.460
The interference is awful.

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:25.210
It must be the barrier's influence.

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:28.790
I can contact you because 
the barrier's weakened,

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:30.210
but please be careful.

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:33.500
Good grief, I'm always telling you, aren't I?

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.290
You can't leave the house on your own.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:41.100
But, but, I really wanted to see for myself.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:44.090
I see. So, what did you think?

00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:45.780
Well...

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:47.350
<i>What are they talking about?</i>

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:51.110
<i>Well, it doesn't matter. 
I'll just fix this for now.</i>

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:56.830
The barrier weakened because the 
Ainsworth family head went outside.

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:02.260
She's a little less reliable than I'd 
heard, but she was really kind!

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:05.250
I see. That's good.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:07.680
<i>Huh? That voice...</i>

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:09.770
The enemy's...

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:11.300
The Ainsworth's...

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:13.350
Shall we go home, then?

00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:15.970
<i>This voice is...</i>

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:17.930
...leader is heading your way.

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:26.060
Listen carefully to this voice.

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:32.320
I am Darius Ainsworth, 
head of the Ainsworth family.

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:34.150
That is your true enemy.

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:37.820
What a tasteless alarm.

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:13.110
<b>Episode 6 
Chilling Hostility</b>

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:20.050
My, what a problem...

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:23.140
That is an annoying and inconsiderate alarm.

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:29.690
For the starting bell, it's absolutely tasteless.

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:33.150
Oh?

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:34.400
Bazett-san!

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:40.320
So you're the mage who erected this barrier?

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:43.640
Devotion to practical application 
is a valid aesthetic.

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:45.530
But as you are a mage,

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:49.410
I wish you would put some thought 
into the stage production.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:52.020
For example, a barrier should be done...

00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:52.920
like this.

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:58.240
<i>Apneic Beauty.</i>

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:01.320
Bazett?

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:03.200
What's this?

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.470
Illya-san!

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:07.180
A-An ice dome?

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:08.470
I'm trapped inside!

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:11.370
My apologies for the impromptu stage,

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:15.040
but I wanted to have a nice, 
peaceful chat with you.

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:17.070
It's a pleasure to meet you,

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:19.980
Illyasviel von Einzbern-kun.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:23.950
I am Darius, head of the Ainsworths.

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:25.910
Y-You're...

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.210
Yes, I am the one

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:30.740
who discovered the Holy Grail named "Miyu,"

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:34.040
created the Cards that draw out 
the power of Heroic Spirits,

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.840
and started the ritual to 
complete the Holy Grail,

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:39.420
the Holy Grail War.

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:42.240
Yes, indeed...

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:47.010
From your perspective, I must seem 
like an overlord to be defeated.

00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:54.360
Not even a crack?

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:55.940
What's going on with this ice?

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:57.360
Move, Bazett!

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:03.800
I'll punch a hole through it.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:16.830
No way...

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:18.540
A Noble Phantasm, then.

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:22.800
And it's an incredibly high-ranking 
Barrier Noble Phantasm!

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:25.170
No way! Illya-san!

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.930
Are you all right?!

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:28.980
Illya-san!

00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:30.940
Open this thing!

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:32.590
So noisy outside...

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:32.600
Illya-san!

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:34.030
Was this a failure?

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:36.060
Open up! Illya-san!

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:36.060
If only it blocked sound, as well.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:38.770
Yes, definitely a failure.

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:40.980
What is?

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:43.250
It's getting unbearably cold...

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:44.110
Huh?

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:46.800
I didn't expect it to have such a weakness.

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:48.700
What's this man trying to do?

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:52.630
I'm not cold at all, so don't 
bring me any blankets.

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:54.190
And she's no better!

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:58.030
Erica-chan, you tricked us?

00:05:58.030 --> 00:06:01.040
You were our enemy, but you 
hid your identity to get close?

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:03.490
Huh? I didn't trick you!

00:06:03.490 --> 00:06:06.080
I just wanted to see for myself, that's all.

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:08.490
I wanted to see if you were the person

00:06:08.490 --> 00:06:10.420
Miyu-oneechan said you were.

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:14.950
We heard about all of you from Miyu.

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:18.480
All those she met, all that happened, everything.

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:20.940
My, indeed...

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:23.440
How wonderful!

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:26.080
Sent to a parallel world!

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:28.900
Forging a pact with a suspicious Mystic Code!

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:33.240
Learning friendship for the first time as 
she faces danger to collect the Cards!

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:36.640
However, her false daily life 
has reached its end,

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:40.000
and Miyu has returned to me once more!

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:46.030
It's a mythology woven of coincidence, 
providence, and fate across multiple worlds!

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:54.870
Thank you for gathering my Cards, Illyasviel!

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:58.320
No, no... I won't ask you to return them!

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:00.810
Use them as you will against—

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:00.810
Papa, Papa!

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:04.940
What is it, Erica?

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:07.940
That's wrong. You're going overboard.

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:10.930
You're right...

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:13.450
I'm not entirely used to it yet.

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:18.330
M-Miyu would never tell you 
all those things on her own!

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:21.580
She never even talked about them with us!

00:07:25.220 --> 00:07:26.550
Tanaka?

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:30.920
Ainsworth...

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:33.730
What did you do to Miyu?!

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:38.890
You shouldn't shout too much.

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:43.480
This frozen palace can't be 
broken from the outside.

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:49.400
But in exchange, the oxygen 
within slowly depletes.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:54.370
And 301 seconds after activation, 
oxygen density becomes zero.

00:07:54.370 --> 00:08:01.080
Yes, we have 301 seconds, 
so let's have a nice, long chat.

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:04.750
Stand back! You should stay out of this!

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:06.500
Hey! Did you hear—

00:08:06.760 --> 00:08:07.620
Ow!

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:11.340
Tanaka, you're...

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:15.840
Oh? That's odd.

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:19.480
Don't tell me you can't even talk anymore?

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:23.540
I suppose I'll have to reconsider.

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:27.230
As an actor, if you can't even ad lib such a part,

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:31.440
then perhaps you aren't necessary to our stage.

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:48.650
Oh, right.

00:08:48.650 --> 00:08:51.630
You were the only one not in Miyu's memory.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.850
How troublesome...

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:56.480
I dislike it when extras ruin the stage.

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:02.430
He parried it?

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:04.730
Ruby!

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:06.230
Illya-san!

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:10.610
<i>Install!</i>

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:28.290
What a lack of common sense, 
swinging such a thing before a child.

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:31.010
What would you do if she got hurt?

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:34.760
<i>Authoritarian Personalism!</i>

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:40.930
My body...

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:44.350
It's not gravity or physical manipulation!

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:47.270
This is Conceptual Interference.

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:50.360
It broke through my runic defense so easily?

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:52.320
Now, then...

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:54.860
Who are you?

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:00.950
Yes, silence is an answer, as well.

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:06.370
But there's no need for an extra 
without lines on my stage.

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:07.370
Stop!

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:10.080
C-Counterfeiter.

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:16.450
I see. Apparently, you aren't an extra.

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:20.660
It would be easy to put a period 
on your performance here,

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:22.880
but that wouldn't be artful.

00:10:22.880 --> 00:10:24.540
I welcome you!

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:27.140
And your inclusion in the cast!

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:28.560
Wait...

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:30.810
Illya-oneechan...

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:33.020
Erica-chan...

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:36.530
You said, "You shouldn't hurt people."

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:57.390
<i>What was that?</i>

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:04.120
<i>What was that?</i>

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:10.440
Man, I went to the usual place to get food...

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:15.180
And I couldn't help but laugh when I saw 
fried rice served with mapo on it!

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:18.550
Hey.

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:22.740
Seriously, where does that 
obsession come from?

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:26.150
I'm thinking of ordering gyoza next time.

00:11:26.150 --> 00:11:28.090
Anyone want to bet on what's in them?

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:29.830
Take a hint, why don't you?

00:11:32.110 --> 00:11:35.340
Something gave me a hint 
that I wouldn't want to.

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:38.330
As soon as I got back, you all were like this.

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:41.510
What happened?

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:46.720
Wow... So Darius came here himself?

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:51.690
Maybe he was trying to get revenge
on Illya-san for invading his base.

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:56.110
Constantly acting counter to the norm could 
potentially destroy the plot, after all.

00:11:56.630 --> 00:11:59.610
He also kept saying things like that, but why?

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:01.200
Why that "stage" and "cast" stuff?

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:03.550
For whatever reason,

00:12:03.550 --> 00:12:06.620
the Ainsworths are particular about 
performance and production.

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:10.000
Evidently, they hate when their 
plans and schedules are broken.

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:11.370
What the heck?

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:13.370
They think they're running a play here?

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:17.260
What's less understandable is his unusual,

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:19.630
almost irrational strength.

00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:25.980
His unidentified Noble Phantasms, 
Apneic Beauty and Authoritarian Personalism.

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:29.870
Plus, his ability to stop Excalibur 
with his bare hands.

00:12:31.530 --> 00:12:32.640
What are those?

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:36.800
A giant dome of ice. It was incredibly tough.

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:38.380
The other was...

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:40.530
No, I don't mean that.

00:12:40.950 --> 00:12:42.310
Those Noble Phantasms...

00:12:42.310 --> 00:12:43.740
I've never heard of them.

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:49.490
My treasury houses the originals for 
almost all the Noble Phantasms.

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.510
Every single Noble Phantasm

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:54.460
is derived from an original that 
matured through history.

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:58.280
All the Noble Phantasms still 
spoken of in the modern era

00:12:58.280 --> 00:13:00.630
were originally mine.

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:03.870
But I'm saying I don't know these two.

00:13:03.870 --> 00:13:08.430
If they really are Noble Phantasms, 
where did they originate?

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:11.220
That's our line.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:15.690
Then, what does that make Tanaka-san,

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:19.230
since she broke through that 
mysterious Noble Phantasm?

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:21.510
She's been asleep ever since.

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:25.060
She doesn't seem to be injured, though.

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:28.240
She's sleeping more peacefully than necessary.

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:31.140
Hey, isn't it a little hot in this room?

00:13:31.140 --> 00:13:33.090
The heater's running too high.

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:35.080
The heater isn't on.

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:37.950
It's hot because of Tanaka's body.

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:40.090
She's like a stone that's been roasted.

00:13:40.780 --> 00:13:43.590
How absurd can she be?

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:49.660
In the end, only Tanaka-san's 
mysterious power had any effect.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:52.100
All of our attacks just...

00:13:52.530 --> 00:13:53.520
Illya...

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:55.810
I know.

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:58.950
I won't complain anymore.

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:01.970
There's no point in wondering why we lost.

00:14:01.970 --> 00:14:04.280
We have to find a way to win.

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:07.700
As long as you understand that.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.950
That's all good, but how are you going to win?

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:16.370
Onee-chan, you're a liar.

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:18.840
<i>I don't...</i>

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:22.590
<i>I don't want to hear that from you!</i>

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:26.500
<i>I just want to save Miyu.</i>

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:44.680
Hey...

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:48.670
How cold.

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:52.700
You don't enjoy surprises like this anymore?

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:56.700
I believe I told you to stop 
linking to my window.

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:59.220
Were you looking at the stars again?

00:14:59.220 --> 00:15:01.250
You never tire of that.

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:05.450
Time for your work. Come.

00:15:08.910 --> 00:15:11.120
Relax, Miyu.

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:13.390
I don't want to be violent with you.

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:15.560
Let go...

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:19.450
This is unusual. Rebelling against me?

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:21.560
When did this start?

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:24.120
That is troublesome.

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:27.700
Bad children need to be punished,

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:30.630
but we mustn't damage your body.

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:32.170
That means...

00:15:33.210 --> 00:15:37.370
Your older brother would have 
to suffer for your wrongdoing.

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:51.180
Good girl.

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:54.140
Don't worry, it will be over soon.

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:57.450
We've done this many times.

00:15:57.450 --> 00:15:59.600
Aren't you used to it?

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:26.280
Behold, Miyu...

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:29.300
Another verse of the myth has been inscribed.

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:31.750
That makes five now!

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:34.760
Only two more until it's complete.

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:37.470
Read it closely.

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:40.470
These are the episodes that 
have occurred around you

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:44.190
between your return to this world and today.

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:51.110
Oh? You passed out?

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:52.540
Good grief...

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:55.620
Do you have any idea how much 
care I'm taking to ensure

00:16:55.620 --> 00:16:57.570
that your body is unharmed?

00:16:57.950 --> 00:17:01.290
I wish you would just endure the phantom pain.

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:05.750
I'm done. Carry her out.

00:17:07.340 --> 00:17:08.460
Yes.

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:16.050
Oh, good morning, Miyu-oneechan!

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:19.010
Erica...

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:21.430
Good job on your work!

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:23.790
I left the medicine to help 
restore your blood here.

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:25.520
Make sure you take it later!

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:31.230
Are you all right? Need to sleep some more?

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:32.220
I'm fine.

00:17:32.220 --> 00:17:34.360
This is nothing new...

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:36.010
Of course!

00:17:36.010 --> 00:17:37.570
It's nothing new, huh?

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:40.250
Oh, right, right!

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:45.320
I brought lots of books so you 
wouldn't be bored, Onee-chan.

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:47.500
You love these, right?

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:51.920
Erica, um, you're always looking out for me.

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:54.470
Thank you.

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:58.380
You don't need to praise me!

00:17:58.380 --> 00:18:00.230
I don't want to be praised at all!

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:02.210
And definitely don't pet my head, okay?

00:18:02.210 --> 00:18:03.360
No matter what!

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:06.730
If say, "Don't do it," three times, don't—

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:15.110
Hey, Erica?

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:16.230
What?

00:18:16.230 --> 00:18:18.880
Did you meet Illya?

00:18:19.380 --> 00:18:22.240
Yeah. She was a kind lady.

00:18:22.650 --> 00:18:25.290
Yeah, I know.

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:28.210
Illya's kind and warm.

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:31.670
Hmm, but she's a bit of a liar, too.

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:33.280
A liar?

00:18:34.310 --> 00:18:37.870
She said, "You shouldn't hurt 
people for no reason,"

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:39.870
but she attacked Papa with a sword.

00:18:39.870 --> 00:18:41.100
That's cruel!

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:43.560
That's...

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:49.020
Honestly, why would Illya-oneechan 
do something like that?

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:54.270
Because Illya's trying to rescue me.

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:57.400
Rescue you? From what?

00:18:58.250 --> 00:19:00.990
From here. From the Ainsworths.

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:04.370
Onee-chan, you'll disappear again?!

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:08.250
If you disappear again, I'll...

00:19:08.820 --> 00:19:10.550
I'll be alone again.

00:19:11.930 --> 00:19:13.080
<i>I see.</i>

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:16.460
<i>So while I was in their world, this girl</i>

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:18.120
<i>was always...</i>

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:21.570
Yeah! I'll be okay!

00:19:21.570 --> 00:19:22.930
I'm a lady.

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:24.560
I'll be fine all by my—

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:28.440
Onee-chan?

00:19:29.260 --> 00:19:31.690
Erica, you're kind.

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:33.720
Kind and strong.

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:38.900
<i>And warped.</i>

00:19:40.810 --> 00:19:46.730
<i>But perhaps I'm just as warped, 
living within my own contradiction.</i>

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:52.290
<i>I know there's absolutely no way 
to win against the Ainsworths.</i>

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:57.520
<i>So I shouldn't hope for rescue.</i>

00:19:57.520 --> 00:19:58.760
<i>But...</i>

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:02.130
<i>Right now, I want to be saved.</i>

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:04.760
<i>I can wish to be saved.</i>

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:07.760
<i>Since I met Illya...</i>

00:20:08.590 --> 00:20:09.850
Miyu!

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:13.540
<i>Honestly, what a contradiction.</i>

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:17.910
<i>Yes, even if Illya did come here...</i>

00:20:21.020 --> 00:20:24.210
<i>What would I do if she did?</i>

00:20:26.180 --> 00:20:27.240
Hey...

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:29.700
What?

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:35.000
I'm fine all by myself, but I 
prefer when you're here.

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:38.420
Right.

00:20:38.990 --> 00:20:42.440
Do you prefer having 
Illya-oneechan with you, too?

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:45.840
Yes, I do.

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:49.060
Okay.

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:52.740
I'm heading back now!

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:54.850
It's almost time for bed.

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:58.220
Later, and goodnight, Miyu-oneechan!

00:21:06.270 --> 00:21:09.440
The stars are hidden.

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:26.800
It's raining?

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:32.310
Tanaka's fast asleep, as always.

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.790
Illya, are you up?

00:21:36.640 --> 00:21:39.270
What should we do for breakfast?

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:42.500
Hey! Are you still asleep?

00:21:47.550 --> 00:21:48.830
Illya?

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:35.970
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:35.970
<b>Dolls and Stuffed Animals</b>

00:23:34.540 --> 00:23:35.220
Huh?
